    "body": "## Summary\n- Re-implemented persistent logging for all significant wallet interactions (mint, melt, swap).\n- Created a structured `WalletLogEntry` model and `WalletLogStore` for persistence.\n- Added a dedicated \"Wallet Logs\" screen in Developer Settings to inspect the paper trail.\n- Added instrumentation for CDK interactions throughout the codebase.\n- Fixed a `FfiException` by recursively sanitizing `amount` fields in payment request payloads.\n- Added localized strings for Lightning address validation.\n\nThis PR re-implements the functionality from #316, addressing the previous issue and including fixes for serialization types.",
